sentences.text:
The present order shall dispose off the above noted four appeals i.e. FAO Nos.10528 and 10529 of 2014 filed by the driver-cum-owner of the offending vehicle; FAO No.709 of 2015 filed by the claimants (parents of the deceased child); and FAO No.2947 of 2015 filed by the injured- claimant;
aggrieved by the impugned award dated 09.10.2024 passed by the Motor Accident Claims Tribunal,
Kurukshetra (hereinafter referred to as 'Tribunal').
